message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "narrative-blink: a parsing account of the attentional blink"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code for a computational-level account of the attentional blink as
  a serial-commitment bottleneck, using visual narrative to make commitment cost
  computable frame by frame.
